{
  "method": "Measured actual WebGL canvas pixels at local controls and sampled bright/dark scene locations, then composited computed browser foreground/background layers. Compared unrounded sRGB contrast ratios against 4.5:1 ordinary text and 3:1 meaningful cues. Borders report interior adjacency; focus rings report solid dark keyline adjacency. Decorative panel borders are not a blanket WCAG requirement. UI was exercised by taps and natural Tab; no game state was injected.",
