  },
  "references": [
    "https://www.w3.org/WAI/WCAG22/Understanding/contrast-minimum.html",
    "https://www.w3.org/WAI/WCAG22/Understanding/non-text-contrast.html"
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Headless Chromium with SwiftShader and DPR1 touch emulation; no physical Android coverage.",
    "Computed foreground colors avoid browser-dependent glyph antialiasing; native-size screenshot inspection remains a separate requirement.",
    "This is a focused contrast audit of these states and samples, not blanket WCAG certification.",
    "Raw detailed reports and logs remain locally in the ignored raw directory; this compact record retains their hashes and selected measurements."
  ],
